        "root_concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "section": "natural-sciences",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nLAYER           DEPTH (km)   DENSITY (g/cm³)  STATE       KEY EVIDENCE\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCrust (oceanic)   0–10         2.9–3.0          Solid       Drilling, seismic refraction\nCrust (continental) 0–35–70   2.7–2.9          Solid       Seismic, isostasy\nUpper mantle      35–410       3.3–3.6          Solid       P/S wave velocities\nTransition zone   410–660      3.6–4.4          Solid       Seismic discontinuities\nLower mantle      660–2890     4.4–5.6          Solid       High-P mineralogy\nOuter core        2890–5150    9.9–12.2         LIQUID      S-waves absent (shadow zone)\nInner core        5150–6371    12.8–13.1        Solid       PKiKP reflections, PKIKP"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "13-GEOPHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:natural-sciences:13-geophysics, git-history:natural-sciences:13-geophysics]",
        "canonical_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "current_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:natural-sciences:geophysics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
