        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "natural-sciences",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "section": "natural-sciences",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Key seismic discontinuities:\n  Mohorovičić (Moho): crust/mantle boundary (~7 km ocean, ~35 km continent)\n  410 km: olivine → wadsleyite phase transition\n  660 km: ringwoodite → bridgmanite + ferropericlase (major barrier to convection)\n  Core-mantle boundary (CMB, 2890 km): dramatic density jump, D″ layer above\n```"
    },
