      },
      "text": "Surface waves (travel along surface, slower, larger amplitude):\n  Love waves:   horizontal shear, faster, no vertical motion\n  Rayleigh waves: elliptical particle motion, slower, most damaging in earthquakes"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#020",
