      },
      "text": "Snell's law for seismic waves:\n  sin(i₁)/v₁ = sin(i₂)/v₂   (same as optics, refraction at layer boundary)\n  Velocity generally increases with depth → seismic rays curve upward"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#021",
