        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Seismic tomography:\n  Measure travel time residuals (observed − predicted) across global station networks\n  Invert for 3D velocity structure (temperature proxy)\n  Fast = cold/dense (subducted slabs); slow = hot/low-density (plumes)\n```"
    },
