        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Reading beach balls:\n  Normal fault:     two black lobes at poles, white equatorial band\n  Reverse fault:    two white lobes at poles, black equatorial band\n  Strike-slip:      alternating black/white quadrants like checkerboard\n  Oblique:          intermediate patterns"
    },
