        "section": "natural-sciences",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nRayleigh number:\n  Ra = α·g·ΔT·d³ / (κ·ν)"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#030",
      "path": [
        "13-GEOPHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:natural-sciences:13-geophysics, git-history:natural-sciences:13-geophysics]",
        "canonical_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "current_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:natural-sciences:geophysics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "natural-sciences",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "section": "natural-sciences",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "α = thermal expansivity (~3 × 10⁻⁵ K⁻¹)\n  g = gravitational acceleration\n  ΔT = temperature difference top-bottom\n  d = layer thickness\n  κ = thermal diffusivity (~10⁻⁶ m²/s)\n  ν = kinematic viscosity"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#031",
      "path": [
        "13-GEOPHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:natural-sciences:13-geophysics, git-history:natural-sciences:13-geophysics]",
        "canonical_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "current_path": "natural-sciences/13-GEOPHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:natural-sciences:geophysics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "natural-sciences",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geophysics]",
        "section": "natural-sciences",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Convection onset: Ra > Ra_crit ≈ 1000 (for free-slip boundaries)\n  Earth's mantle: Ra ~ 10⁷ → vigorous convection"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-GEOPHYSICS.md#032",
      "path": [
        "13-GEOPHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:natural-sciences:13-geophysics, git-history:natural-sciences:13-geophysics]",
