        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Mantle viscosity: ~10²¹ Pa·s (lower mantle) to ~10²⁰ Pa·s (upper mantle)\n  Highly non-Newtonian: dislocation creep (power law) + diffusion creep\n  Temperature-dependent: hot rock flows, cold lithosphere rigid"
    },
