        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "13-GEOPHYSICS - Geophysics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Convection pattern:\n  Upwelling: hot material rises (mid-ocean ridges, hot spots)\n  Downwelling: cold material sinks (subducting slabs — most efficient cooling)\n  Whole mantle vs layered convection: ongoing debate\n  660 km discontinuity: partial filter → mostly whole-mantle with some ponding\n```"
